x;\n}\n.hr.av-2x1lha-2617dcd7ec01110d2e6795482f60ebd3 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-2x1lha-2617dcd7ec01110d2e6795482f60ebd3 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lygqtgb2-84da7031129adf7c9461539abfbb7530 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Du 2 au 4 octobre 2023, nous avons particip\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9dition du 20e anniversaire d\u2019Automechanika Dubai.<\/p>\n<p>Ce fut une excellente occasion d\u2019\u00e9tablir de nouveaux contacts commerciaux, de d\u00e9velopper les relations d\u2019affaires existantes et d\u2019\u00e9changer des connaissances et des exp\u00e9riences. Nous sommes tr\u00e8s heureux que vous ayez visit\u00e9 notre stand en si grand nombre. Nous vous remercions pour chaque mot gentil et nous esp\u00e9rons vous revoir l\u2019ann\u00e9e prochaine.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyj1rw22-2225e0c7373bb2666795e2317e9c26bb\">\n#top .avia-gallery.av-lyj1rw22-2225e0c7373bb2666795e2317e9c26bb .avia-gallery-thumb a{\nwidth:33.3333%;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='avia-gallery av-lyj1rw22-2225e0c7373bb2666795e2317e9c26bb avia_animate_when_visible  avia-builder-el-3  el_after_av_textblock  el_before_av_button  avia_lazyload avia-gallery-animate avia-gallery-1'  itemprop=\"image\" itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/ImageObject\" ><meta itemprop=\"contentURL\" content=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/fr\/automechanika-dubai-2023-5\/\"><div class='avia-gallery-thumb'><a href=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Automechanika-Dubai-2023-01-3.jpg\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-content\/upl